# Gallery Album Seed, OCR Filter & Cover Images

## Overview

When building or cleaning a **gallery album** from local/static images (homepage, events, logos, executive committee), prefer **one-off Node scripts** that call the backend with a service JWT. Do **not** change app server actions or proxy handlers for tenant seed/cleanup unless the product feature itself needs a permanent UI/API change.

Use **image scraping / OCR** to decide which uploads belong in the album (e.g. keep only images that visibly contain **“mcefee”**), and keep **executive-committee** headshots that match `/admin/executive-committee`.

