| [`scripts/filter-mcefee-gallery-album.mjs`](mdc:scripts/filter-mcefee-gallery-album.mjs) | OCR/filename filter + exec-team photos; **DELETE** media that do not match |
| [`scripts/seed-mcefee-executive-team.mjs`](mdc:scripts/seed-mcefee-executive-team.mjs) | Seed executive committee roster + `profileImageUrl` from charity-site team images |
