## Checklist for a New Brand/Album Seed

- [ ] Script under `scripts/` reusing `gallery-porting-lib.mjs` (no app-code churn)
- [ ] `--dry-run` before destructive deletes
- [ ] Upload → PATCH `albumId` → verify `GET .../event-medias?albumId.equals=`
- [ ] OCR/filename filter (never description-only)
- [ ] Exec-team photos from admin roster if required
- [ ] Cover via `coverImageUrl` pointing at a kept media `fileUrl`
- [ ] Spot-check gallery UI (`/gallery`, `/admin/gallery/albums/{id}`)
